t\":\"$undefined\",\"title\":\"Food \u0026 drinks\"},{\"description\":\"What's more fun than a day trip to Eindhoven? A two-day trip to Eindhoven! Make the most of your visit with an overnight stay!\",\"href\":\"/en/see-and-do/hotels\",\"imageAlt\":\"Spend the night\",\"imageObjectPosition\":\"$undefined\",\"imageTitle\":\"$undefined\",\"imgSrc\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/cwuu6lx4/production/7a73f4cce8322d9c2c1b779e3f8e9899f85f421d-1618x1080.jpg\",\"readMoreText\":\"Read more\",\"rel\":\"$undefined\",\"tag\":\"Hotels\",\"target\":\"$undefined\",\"title\":\"Spend the night\"},{\"description\":\"Eindhoven is the shopping city of the south of the Netherlands, offering high fashion, Dutch design, local markets, and vintage stores.\",\"href\":\"/en/see-and-do/shopping\",\"imageAlt\":\"Shopping in Eindhoven\",\"imageObjectPosition\":\"$undefined\",\"imageTitle\":\"$undefined\",\"imgSrc\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/cwuu6lx4/production/e71c011ae3271359315757ffe8ec8adcb3855978-1920x1280.jpg\",\"readMoreText\":\"Read more\",\"rel\":\"$undefined\",\"tag\":\"Shopping\",\"target\":\"$undefined\",\"title\":\"Shopping in Eindhoven\"},{\"description\":\"Eindhoven is the perfect city to get your dose of culture and design. Visit our top museums, design studios, and art centers, and discover why we are the design capital of the Netherlands!\",\"href\":\"/en/see-and-do/culture-and-design\",\"imageAlt\":\"Culture \u0026 design\",\"imageObjectPosition\":\"$undefined\",\"imageTitle\":\"Max Kneefel\",\"imgSrc\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/cwuu6lx4/production/92ab9b2681da9ab1835d523aeb8342dea5b63ed9-799x533.jpg\",\"readMoreText\":\"Read more\",\"rel\":\"$undefined\",\"tag\":\"$undefined\",\"target\":\"$undefined\",\"title\":\"Culture \u0026 design\"}],\"labels\":{\"next\":\"Next\",\"previous\":\"Previous\",\"dotLabel\":\"Go to slide\",\"dotsAriaLabel\":\"Slide selector\",\"carouselLabel\":\"Articles carousel\"},\"theme\":\"beige\",\"title\":\"Inspiration for your Eindhoven adve