are free! Discover the crème de la crème of budget-friendly activities in this list!\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"15\",{\"name\":\"twitter:image\",\"content\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/cwuu6lx4/production/c6305071e075fddaa46a748642ed14d59f71783f-1843x1229.jpg\"}]]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"31:\"HeroWithImageWide\"\n32:I[329237,[\"$19\",\"$1a\",\"$1b\",\"$1c\",\"$2d\",\"$20\",\"$2e\"],\"$31\"]\nc:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"pb-20\",\"children\":[null,[null,[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:gap-16\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"section\",\"synth-0000\",{\"className\":\"scroll-mt-24\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L32\",null,{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"backLink\":{\"href\":\"/en/see-and-do/fun-things-to-do\",\"label\":\"Back to Fun things to do\"},\"bleedBackground\":true,\"cta\":\"$undefined\",\"date\":\"2026-01-07T00:00:00+01:00\",\"imageAlt\":\"10x Eindhoven on a budget\",\"imageObjectPosition\":\"$undefined\",\"imageSrc\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/cwuu6lx4/production/c6305071e075fddaa46a748642ed14d59f71783f-1843x1229.jpg\",\"imageTitle\":\"Nick Bookelaar\",\"layout\":\"wide\",\"location\":\"$undefined\",\"mediaPosition\":\"right\",\"mobileHideMedia\":\"$undefined\",\"priority\":true,\"readTime\":\"6 min\",\"theme\":\"beige\",\"title\":\"10x Eindhoven on a budget\",\"videoUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"withBottomPadding\":\"$undefined\",\"withTopPadding\":\"$undefined\"}]}],[\"$\",\"section\",\"6886b4b7-a80\",{\"className\":\"scroll-mt-24 px-4 md:px-6 lg:px-5 min-[1440px]:px-0\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto w-full px-2 md:w-[83.34%] lg:w-[66.67%] xl:w-full xl:max-w-[626px] pt-4 tie-rich-text\",\"data-testid\":\"rich-text-block-section\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"000m91\",{\"className\":\"text-intro tie-type-intro\",\"children\":[\"The best things in life are free. Well, if you believe Coco Chanel. She did add: \\\"And the second-best things are very, very expensive.\\\" Anyway, the message is clear. Discover the crème de la crème of budget-friendly activities in this list.\"]}],[\"$\",\"h2\",\"000m93\",{\"children\":[\"Bargain festivals\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"000m95\",{\"children\":[\"Would you rather party than watch a movie? Eindhoven hosts a variety of free festivals every year. Like \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"000m97\",{\"href\":\"/en/events/dutch-chili-fest\",\"rel\":\"$undefined\",\"target\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"Dutch Chili Fest\"]}],\", where daredevils treat their taste buds and ears to muy picante dishes and matching music. Or \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"000m99\",{\"href\":\"https://sites.ggze.nl/groups/34-vanstreek-festival/welcome\",\"rel\":\"$undefined\",\"target\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"Vanstreek Festival\"]}],\", fun for both adults and kids. Enjoy fine music and lots of tasty goods at \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"000m9b\",{\"href\":\"/nl/locaties/wasvenboerderij\",\"rel\":\"$undefined\",\"target\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"Effenaar 't Wasven\"]}],\".\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"000m9d\",{\"children\":[\"Pssst... An extra tip. \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"000m9f\",{\"href\":\"/nl/evenementen\",\"rel\":\"$undefined\",\"target\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"You’ll find an up-to-date list of all upcoming festivals and other events here\"]}],\". We mention the ticket prices, so you can see if they fit your budget.\"]}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"section\",\"75772ece-35b\",{\"className\":\"scroll-mt-24 px-4 md:px-6 lg:px-5 min-[1440px]:px-0\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto w-full max-w-[1050px]\",\"data-testid\":\"dual-image-portrait-section\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"figure\",null,{\"className\":\"m-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"figure\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"m-0 min-w-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative h-0 overflow-hidden w-full\",\"style\":{\"paddingBottom\":\"149%\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L2b\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover\",\"title\":\"\",\"style\":\"$undefined\",\"alt\":\"Van Abbemuseum\",\"blurDataURL\":\"$undefined\",\"fill\":true,\"loading\":\"$undefined\",\"placeholder\":\"$undefined\",\"preload\":false,\"quality\":\"$undefined\",\"sizes\":\"100vw\",\"src\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/cwuu6lx4/production/7c9e4ff0d42e880f41abc2ca0f7c8b5243d70b6a-853x1280.jpg\"}]}],null]}],null]}],[\"$\",\"figure\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"m-0 min-w-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative h-0 overflow-hidden w-full\",\"style\":{\"paddingBottom\":\"149%\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L2b\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover\",\"title\":\"\",\"style\":\"$undefined\",\"alt\":\"Van Abbemuseum\",\"blurDataURL\":\"$undefined\",\"fill\":true,\"loading\":\"$undefined\",\"placeholder\":\"$undefined\",\"preload\":false,\"quality\":\"$undefined\",\"sizes\":\"100vw\",\"src\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/cwuu6lx4/production/0104d13150cbf6f4981774fd92026b1c18a54bcf-853x1280.jpg\"}]}],null]}],null]}]]}],[\"$\",\"figcaption\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 tie-type-body text-[16px] leading-6 [\u0026_a]:text-[var(--tie-theme-accent)] [\u0026_a]:underline lg:[\u0026_a:hover]:no-underline\",\"children\":\"$L33\"}]]}]}]}],\"$L34\",\"$L35\",\"$L36\",\"$L37\",\"$L38\",\"$L39\",\"$L3a\",\"$L3b\",\"$L3c\",\"$L3d\"]}]]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"3e:\"NewsletterSubscribeRenderer\"\n3f:I[934756,[\"$19\",\"$1a\",\"$1b\",\"$1c\",\"$2d\",\"$20\",\"$2e\"],\"$3e\"]\n33:[[\"$\",\"p\",\"000m9h\",{\"children\":[\"Image\"]}]]\n34:[\"$\",\"section\",\"a60389da-8a9\",{\"className\":\"scroll-mt-24 px-4 md:px-6 lg:px-5 min-[1440px]:px-0\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto w-full px-2 md:w-[83.34%] lg:w-[66.67%] xl:w-full xl:max-w-[626px] pt-4 tie-rich-text\",\"data-testid\":\"rich-text-block-section\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",\"000m9t\",{\"children\":[\"Galleries that won’t break the bank\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"000m9v\",{\"children\":[\"Eindhoven and design are thick as thieves. Maybe you wouldn’t expect it, but the city is overflowing with great art, too. As an art lover, you can discover gems in various places in the city. Even if you don't feel like taking out your wallet.\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"000m9x\",{\"children\":[\"On Wednesdays, there’s no entrance fee for \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"000m9z\",{\"href\":\"/en/locations/mu-hybrid-art-house\",\"rel\":\"$undefined\",\"target\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"MU Hybrid Art House\"]}],\". The exhibitions in the former Philips factory at Strijp-S revolve around art in the broadest sense of the word.\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"000ma1\",{\"children\":[\"In the \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"000ma3\",{\"href\":\"/en/locations/van-abbemuseum\",\"rel\":\"$undefined\",\"target\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"Van Abbemuseum\"]}],\" you also don’t have to spend a dime to see the finest art. Well, if you happen to be free on a Tuesday afternoon between 3 and 5 pm, that is.\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"000ma5\",{\"children\":[\"And the doors of \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"000ma7\",{\"href\":\"/en/locations/kevn\",\"rel\":\"$undefined\",\"target\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"KEVN\"]}],\" in the Woensel-West district are always open to art aficionados with a flat wallet. The monumental school building is an exhibition space, restaurant, and creative incubator all in one.\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"000ma9\",{\"children\":[\"Don't forget to get inspired by \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"000mab\",{\"href\":\"/en/locations/piet-hein-eek\",\"rel\":\"$undefined\",\"target\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"Piet Hein Eek\"]}],\". Piet Hein Eek has his workshop, store, restaurant, exhibition space, and event location in the former Philips ceramic workshop.\"]}],[\"$\",\"h2\",\"000mad\",{\"children\":[\"Take the scenic route\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"000maf\",{\"children\":[\"Walking and cycling, dull? Pfft, no way. Even less so with the many beautiful walking and cycling routes that Eindhoven has to offer. For example, explore Eindhoven’s nature with \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"000mah\",{\"href\":\"/nl/zien-en-doen/leuke-dingen-doen/wandelroutes-natuur\",\"rel\":\"$undefined\",\"target\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"these four walking routes\"]}],\". Throw on your best windbreaker and enjoy! Is technical clothing not your thing, and would you rather stay downtown? Then check out \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"000maj\",{\"href\":\"/nl/zien-en-doen/cultuur-en-design/design-in-de-openbare-ruimte\",\"rel\":\"$undefined\",\"target\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"these 10 design objects in the public space\"]}],\".\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"000mal\",{\"children\":[\"If you're an architecture geek, we have a special gift for you: \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"000man\",{\"href\":\"/nl/zien-en-doen/leuke-dingen-doen/wandelroute-architectuur\",\"rel\":\"$undefined\",\"target\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"this mapped-out route along architectural highlights\"]}],\". Including your very own digital city guide. You're welcome.\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"000map\",{\"children\":[\"If you'd rather hop on your trusty bike, you can make do with these \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"000mar\",{\"href\":\"/nl/zien-en-doen/leuke-dingen-doen/fietsroutes-in-en-rondom-eindhoven\",\"rel\":\"$undefined\",\"target\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"five cycling routes in and around Eindhoven.\"]}]]}]]}]}]\n35:[\"$\",\"section\",\"fc585589-a20\",{\"className\":\"scroll-mt-24 px-4 md:px-6 lg:px-5 min-[1440px]:px-0\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto w-full max-w-[1050px]\",\"data-testid\":\"dual-image-portrait-section\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"figure\",null,{\"className\":\"m-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"figure\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"m-0 min-w-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative h-0 overflow-hidden w-full\",\"style\":{\"paddingBottom\":\"149%\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L2b\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover\",\"title\":\"\",\"style\":\"$undefined\",\"alt\":\"Berenkuil\",\"blurDataURL\":\"$undefined\",\"fill\":true,\"loading\":\"$undefined\",\"placeholder\":\"$undefined\",\"preload\":false,\"quality\":\"$undefined\",\"sizes\":\"100vw\",\"src\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/cwuu6lx4/production/2fb05f8b7228445fdbb8c273cbcb6c8693b0f1bb-854x1280.jpg\"}]}],null]}],null]}],[\"$\",\"figure\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"m-0 min-w-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative h-0 overflow-hidden w-full\",\"style\":{\"paddingBottom\":\"149%\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L2b\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover\",\"title\":\"\",\"style\":\"$undefined\",\"alt\":\"Berenkuil\",\"blurDataURL\":\"$undefined\",\"fill\":true,\"loading\":\"$undefined\",\"placeholder\":\"$undefined\",\"preload\":false,\"quality\":\"$undefined\",\"sizes\":\"100vw\",\"src\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/cwuu6lx4/production/bee0316a34b9fb31494a70b1d92663021ac93ecc-854x1280.jpg\"}]}],null]}],null]}]]}],[\"$\",\"figcaption\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 tie-type-body text-[16px] leading-6 [\u0026_a]:text-[var(--tie-theme-accent)] [\u0026_a]:underline lg:[\u0026_a:hover]:no-underline\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"000mas\",{\"children\":[\"Image\"]}]]}]]}]}]}]\n36:[\"$\",\"section\",\"2e41fce6-4cb\",{\"className\":\"scroll-mt-24 px-4 md:px-6 lg:px-5 min-[1440px]:px-0\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto w-full px-2 md:w-[83.34%] lg:w-[66.67%] xl:w-full xl:max-w-[626px] pt-4 tie-rich-text\",\"data-testid\":\"rich-text-block-section\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",\"000maz\",{\"children\":[\"The FeelGood Market has something for everyone\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"000mb1\",{\"children\":[\"Okay, a market is by definition a place where you go shopping. But you don't have to! \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"000mb3\",{\"href\":\"/en/events/feelgood-market\",\"rel\":\"$undefined\",\"target\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"The FeelGood Market\"]}],\" by the \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"000mb5\",{\"href\":\"/nl/locaties/ketelhuisplein\",\"rel\":\"$undefined\",\"target\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"Ketelhuisplein\"]}],\" is also a meeting place, where you can sit down and relax, lazily stroll along stalls and really take in the Strijp-S vibe. Often, you’ll find live music or theater going on. And if you’re tempted to buy something after all, you know at the FeelGood Market it’s going to be a sustainable, handmade, and local product. And that's worth something too.\"]}],[\"$\",\"h2\",\"000mb7\",{\"children\":[\"Between art and Peter Pan Speedrock\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"000mb9\",{\"children\":[\"Eindhoven is actually an open-air museum. If you look closely, you will see hidden galleries everywhere. The city has embraced street art like no other. From a more than 700 feet long mural created by 30 international artists to a life-sized graffiti version of Peter Pan Speedrock. \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"000mbb\",{\"href\":\"/en/see-and-do/culture-and-design/street-art-in-eindhoven\",\"rel\":\"$undefined\",\"target\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"Here you’ll find a handy list of our best street art tips\"]}],\".\"]}]]}]}]\n37:[\"$\",\"section\",\"e5d6c48d-ca0\",{\"className\":\"scroll-mt-24 px-4 md:px-6 lg:px-5 min-[1440px]:px-0\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto w-full max-w-[1050px]\",\"data-testid\":\"dual-image-portrait-section\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"figure\",null,{\"className\":\"m-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"figure\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"m-0 min-w-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative h-0 overflow-hidden w-full\",\"style\":{\"paddingBottom\":\"149%\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L2b\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover\",\"title\":\"\",\"style\":\"$undefined\",\"alt\":\"FeelGood Market\",\"blurDataURL\":\"$undefined\",\"fill\":true,\"loading\":\"$undefined\",\"placeholder\":\"$undefined\",\"preload\":false,\"quality\":\"$undefined\",\"sizes\":\"100vw\",\"src\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/cwuu6lx4/production/dea3a303f0327e00fb92beebdc6d672b0fca5087-853x1280.jpg\"}]}],null]}],null]}],[\"$\",\"figure\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"m-0 min-w-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative h-0 overflow-hidden w-full\",\"style\":{\"paddingBottom\":\"149%\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L2b\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover\",\"title\":\"\",\"style\":\"$undefined\",\"alt\":\"FeelGood Market\",\"blurDataURL\":\"$undefined\",\"fill\":true,\"loading\":\"$undefined\",\"placeholder\":\"$undefined\",\"preload\":false,\"quality\":\"$undefined\",\"sizes\":\"100vw\",\"src\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/cwuu6lx4/production/2a82c962175409f3bfcbaac03949042a42b906ed-853x1280.jpg\"}]}],null]}],null]}]]}],[\"$\",\"figcaption\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 tie-type-body text-[16px] leading-6 [\u0026_a]:text-[var(--tie-theme-accent)] [\u0026_a]:underline lg:[\u0026_a:hover]:no-underline\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"000mbd\",{\"children\":[\"Image\"]}]]}]]}]}]}]\n38:[\"$\",\"section\",\"71a58aa9-142\",{\"className\":\"scroll-mt-24 px-4 md:px-6 lg:px-5 min-[1440px]:px-0\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto w-full px-2 md:w-[83.34%] lg:w-[66.67%] xl:w-full xl:max-w-[626px] pt-4 tie-rich-text\",\"data-testid\":\"rich-text-block-section\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",\"000mbl\",{\"children\":[\"Budget bites\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"000mbn\",{\"children\":[\"Great food doesn't have to cost a lot. \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"000mbp\",{\"href\":\"/en/see-and-do/tips-by-locals/hotspots-of-the-big-red-arrow\",\"rel\":\"$undefined\",\"target\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"These thirty Eindhoven foodie hotspots prove that point\"]}],\". Extra addition to the list is \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"000mbr\",{\"href\":\"/en/locations/down-town-gourmet-market\",\"rel\":\"$undefined\",\"target\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"Down Town Gourmet Market\"]}],\". At Down Town Gourmet Market you can make your dining experience as expensive (or as affordable) as you like. Whatever you’re into, Down Town delivers. You can choose from the menus of many different affiliated restaurants, right from the comfort of your own (restaurant) chair.\"]}],[\"$\",\"h2\",\"000mbt\",{\"children\":[\"Love (and parks) don’t cost a thing\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"000mbv\",{\"children\":[\"Grab your favorite picnic blanket and settle down in one of \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"000mbx\",{\"href\":\"/nl/zien-en-doen/recreatie/13x-eindhovense-parken\",\"rel\":\"$undefined\",\"target\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"these fifteen (!) parks\"]}],\". Bring a freshly baked baguette, something to drink, and good company, and your low-budget afternoon is complete. You just need the weather on your side. But you can always bring a thermos of hot chocolate or go for a brisk walk.\"]}]]}]}]\n39:[\"$\",\"section\",\"37bbda60-c60\",{\"className\":\"scroll-mt-24 px-4 md:px-6 lg:px-5 min-[1440px]:px-0\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto w-full max-w-[1050px]\",\"data-testid\":\"dual-image-portrait-section\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"figure\",null,{\"className\":\"m-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"figure\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"m-0 min-w-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative h-0 overflow-hidden w-full\",\"style\":{\"paddingBottom\":\"149%\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L2b\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover\",\"title\":\"Cleo Goossens\",\"style\":\"$undefined\",\"alt\":\"Dutch Design Week\",\"blurDataURL\":\"$undefined\",\"fill\":true,\"loading\":\"$undefined\",\"placeholder\":\"$undefined\",\"preload\":false,\"quality\":\"$undefined\",\"sizes\":\"100vw\",\"src\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/cwuu6lx4/production/3f2cc7bf678693c7778e413035fa5d977ef44e73-915x1280.jpg\"}]}],null]}],null]}],[\"$\",\"figure\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"m-0 min-w-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative h-0 overflow-hidden w-full\",\"style\":{\"paddingBottom\":\"149%\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L2b\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover\",\"title\":\"Cleo Goossens\",\"style\":\"$undefined\",\"alt\":\"Dutch Design Week\",\"blurDataURL\":\"$undefined\",\"fill\":true,\"loading\":\"$undefined\",\"placeholder\":\"$undefined\",\"preload\":false,\"quality\":\"$undefined\",\"sizes\":\"100vw\",\"src\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/cwuu6lx4/production/ce5b8286a263466050621f7cd742083edc35f4f0-914x1280.jpg\"}]}],null]}],null]}]]}],[\"$\",\"figcaption\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 tie-type-body text-[16px] leading-6 [\u0026_a]:text-[var(--tie-theme-accent)] [\u0026_a]:underline lg:[\u0026_a:hover]:no-underline\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"000mbz\",{\"children\":[\"Image\"]}]]}]]}]}]}]\n3a:[\"$\",\"section\",\"5d02f0a7-71f\",{\"className\":\"scroll-mt-24 px-4 md:px-6 lg:px-5 min-[1440px]:px-0\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto w-full px-2 md:w-[83.34%] lg:w-[66.67%] xl:w-full xl:max-w-[626px] pt-4 tie-rich-text\",\"data-testid\":\"rich-text-block-section\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",\"000mc5\",{\"children\":[\"Cozy lights and liberation\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"000mc7\",{\"children\":[\"Yes, summer has its charm. Long sunny days, countless festivals, strolling outside without a coat... We get it. But not to worry, \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"000mc9\",{\"href\":\"/en/see-and-do/autumn-in-eindhoven\",\"rel\":\"$undefined\",\"target\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"fall in Eindhoven has more than enough to offer\"]}],\"! From September 18 to mid-October, you can walk (or cycle) the cozy Lichtjesroute. The Lichtjesroute is 13 miles long and runs through the center of Eindhoven, and the districts Stratum, Strijp, and Woensel. All those cozy lights along the way are sure to give you that ultimate fall feeling. Some background info: The route is organized by volunteers as a tribute to the liberation by the Allied troops on September 18, 1944.\"]}],[\"$\",\"h2\",\"000mcb\",{\"children\":[\"Nine days of Dutch design\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"000mcd\",{\"children\":[\"Say Eindhoven, and you say design. As a true design city, it makes sense that Eindhoven hosts the largest design event in Northern Europe. During the \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"000mcf\",{\"href\":\"/en/see-and-do/culture-and-design/dutch-design-week-for-beginners\",\"rel\":\"$undefined\",\"target\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"Dutch Design Week\"]}],\" in October, the city is taken over by – you guessed it – design! For nine days, people from all over the world come to admire the work of the most talented, inspiring designers. More than 2,600 designers present their work and concepts during DDW. You can wander around and let yourself be surprised, or follow one of the mapped-out routes. That way you’re sure to miss nothing. Some DDW locations are free of charge, but an all-week-pass won’t break the bank either. For about 25 euros, you get nine days of access to all the DDW hotspots.\"]}],[\"$\",\"h2\",\"000mch\",{\"children\":[\"Eindhovens GLOW-up\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"000mcj\",{\"children\":[\"Every year in November, Eindhoven has a real-life glow-up. The whole city changes before your eyes during GLOW. GLOW is a free-to-visit light art festival. With buildings, parks, roofs, and streets as their canvas, about 35 artists paint with light. Also, there are all kinds of events around the festival. GLOW ensures there is something to see and experience throughout the whole city.\"]}]]}]}]\n3b:[\"$\",\"section\",\"category-buttons-5884\",{\"className\":\"scroll-mt-24 px-4 md:px-6 lg:px-5 min-[1440px]:px-0\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto w-full max-w-[626px] tie-border-accent flex flex-col gap-4 border-y py-6\",\"data-testid\":\"category-buttons-section\",\"data-tie-theme\":\"beige\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"tie-type-eyebrow tie-color-accent m-0\",\"children\":\"Tags\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-wrap gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",\"/en/search?searchterm=Practical+info-Practical info\",{\"className\":\"tie-type-button group inline-flex min-h-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center px-4 py-3 no-underline focus-visible:tie-focus-ring transition-[background-color,border-color,color,opacity] duration-200 ease-in-out border-2 tie-border-accent tie-color-accent hover:[background-color:var(--tie-theme-accent)] hover:[color:var(--tie-theme-on-accent)]\",\"href\":\"/en/search?searchterm=Practical+info\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Practical info\"}]}],[\"$\",\"a\",\"/en/search?searchterm=Recreation-Recreation\",{\"className\":\"tie-type-button group inline-flex min-h-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center px-4 py-3 no-underline focus-visible:tie-focus-ring transition-[background-color,border-color,color,opacity] duration-200 ease-in-out border-2 tie-border-accent tie-color-accent hover:[background-color:var(--tie-theme-accent)] hover:[color:var(--tie-theme-on-accent)]\",\"href\":\"/en/search?searchterm=Recreation\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Recreation\"}]}],[\"$\",\"a\",\"/en/search?searchterm=Culture+and+design-Culture and design\",{\"className\":\"tie-type-button group inline-flex min-h-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center px-4 py-3 no-underline focus-visible:tie-focus-ring transition-[background-color,border-color,color,opacity] duration-200 ease-in-out border-2 tie-border-accent tie-color-accent hover:[background-color:var(--tie-theme-accent)] hover:[color:var(--tie-theme-on-accent)]\",\"href\":\"/en/search?searchterm=Culture+and+design\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Culture and design\"}]}],[\"$\",\"a\",\"/en/search?searchterm=Events-Events\",{\"className\":\"tie-type-button group inline-flex min-h-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center px-4 py-3 no-underline focus-visible:tie-focus-ring transition-[background-color,border-color,color,opacity] duration-200 ease-in-out border-2 tie-border-accent tie-color-accent hover:[background-color:var(--tie-theme-accent)] hover:[color:var(--tie-theme-on-accent)]\",\"href\":\"/en/search?searchterm=Events\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Events\"}]}]]}]]}]}]\n3c:[\"$\",\"section\",\"c7898c31-ce0\",{\"className\":\"scroll-mt-24 px-4 md:px-6 lg:px-5 min-[1440px]:px-0\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L3f\",null,{\"component\":{\"_key\":\"c7898c31-ce0\",\"_type\":\"newsletterSubscription\",\"anchorMenu\":null,\"renderingVariant\":null,\"subscription\":{\"consentText\":null,\"hasThankYouPage\":true,\"privacyHref\":null,\"privacyLinkLabel\":null,\"submitLabel\":null,\"thankYouPath\":\"/en/newsletter-thanks\",\"theme\":\"beige\",\"title\":\"Free fun needs to be shared\"}},\"locale\":\"en\",\"pageTheme\":\"beige\"}]}]\n3d:[\"$\",\"section\",\"24da8922-35f\",{\"className\":\"scroll-mt-24 px-4 md:px-6 lg:px-5 min-[1440px]:px-0\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L30\",null,{\"cta\":\"$undefined\",\"eyebrow\":\"Recreation\",\"fullBleed\":false,\"items\":[{\"description\":\"You don't have to go far in Eindhoven for a breath of fresh air with one of these fifteen beautiful parks!\",\"href\":\"/en/see-and-do/fun-things-to-do/evergeen-eindhoven-parks\",\"imageAlt\":\"Evergreen: 15x Eindhoven parks\",\"imageObjectPosition\":\"$undefined\",\"imageTitle\":\"$undefined\",\"imgSrc\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/cwuu6lx4/production/e1195a4bbdbfff6dbc22bc3d4dab0b2ec97bed93-2048x1365.jpg\",\"readMoreText\":\"Read more\",\"rel\":\"$undefined\",\"tag\":\"Nature\",\"target\":\"$undefined\",\"title\":\"Evergreen: 15x Eindhoven parks\"},{\"description\":\"There is enough green for everyone in Eindhoven. Want to stretch your legs? Go for a walk in one of the many city parks. These walking routes take you on a journey through the Eindhoven nature!\",\"href\":\"/en/see-and-do/fun-things-to-do/walking-routes-nature\",\"imageAlt\":\"Let's go outside: 4x Walks in nature\",\"imageObjectPosition\":\"$undefined\",\"imageTitle\":\"Max Kneefel\",\"imgSrc\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/cwuu6lx4/production/399d8e797e9c7afcffa60e1c557deecba07dd48f-2048x1365.jpg\",\"readMoreText\":\"Read more\",\"rel\":\"$undefined\",\"tag\":\"Nature\",\"target\":\"$undefined\",\"title\":\"Let's go outside: 4x Walks in nature\"},{\"description\":\"Let's be honest, Eindhoven is far from being a coastal town. Still, there are plenty of places to chill out on the quayside. We've listed our (almost) waterfront tips!\",\"href\":\"/en/see-and-do/fun-things-to-do/keep-cool-places-almost-on-the-waterfront\",\"imageAlt\":\"Keep cool: 9x Places (almost) on the waterfront\",\"imageObjectPosition\":\"$undefined\",\"imageTitle\":\"Max Kneefel\",\"imgSrc\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/cwuu6lx4/production/b723cb957e8b3043dbbbba0644b7cce79afa6cfc-1638x1092.jpg\",\"readMoreText\":\"Read more\",\"rel\":\"$undefined\",\"tag\":\"Nature\",\"target\":\"$undefined\",\"title\":\"Keep cool: 9x Places (almost) on the waterfront\"},{\"description\":\"Eindhoven has countless restaurants to enjoy, but did you know that there are lots of hidden courtyards? Check out this list on where to find them!\",\"href\":\"/en/see-and-do/fun-things-to-do/hidden-city-gardens\",\"imageAlt\":\"8x Hidden city gardens\",\"imageObjectPosition\":\"$undefined\",\"imageTitle\":\"$undefined\",\"imgSrc\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/cwuu6lx4/production/f71fc102c08a6204238ee3517c972072bfe63c35-3000x2000.jpg\",\"readMoreText\":\"Read more\",\"rel\":\"$undefined\",\"tag\":\"Nature\",\"target\":\"$undefined\",\"title\":\"8x Hidden city gardens\"},{\"description\":\"Discover the outdoor possibilities in Eindhoven and its surroundings and get ready to explore. Check out our tips!\",\"href\":\"/en/see-and-do/fun-things-to-do/green-outdoor-activities\",\"imageAlt\":\"7x Green outdoor activities\",\"imageObjectPosition\":\"$undefined\",\"imageTitle\":\"$undefined\",\"imgSrc\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/cwuu6lx4/production/75d12b2734137215c0a56887e50472d42d79c6c1-6009x4006.jpg\",\"readMoreText\":\"Read more\",\"rel\":\"$undefined\",\"tag\":\"Nature\",\"target\":\"$undefined\",\"title\":\"7x Green outdoor activities\"}],\"labels\":{\"next\":\"Next\",\"previous\":\"Previous\",\"dotLabel\":\"Go to slide\",\"dotsAriaLabel\":\"Slide selector\",\"carouselLabel\":\"Articles carousel\"},\"theme\":\"beige\",\"title\":\"The greenest side of Eindhoven\",\"variant\":\"related\"}]}]\n"])</script></body></html>